Term of Agreement.This Agreement is effective when all parties have executed it
(Effective Date).The Period of Performance of the Agreement is from May 28,2019
through August 5, 2022.All services shall be completed during the Period of Performance.
4.
Payment.
A.
The Agency agrees to pay the Sub recipient for the services described in Section 5
