with attached backup documentation including invoices andproof ofpayment.
Payment shall be made within forty-five (45) days after submission of invoices and
proof of payment pursuant to Wyo. Stat.$ 16-6-602.Sub recipient shall submit
invoices in sufficient detail to ensure that payments may bemade in conformance
with this Agreement.
